      "blocks": {
        "er_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Orders and shipping",
            "anchor_id": "orders",
            "content": "<p><strong>When will my order ship?</strong></p><p>Most orders ship within two business days. Tracking arrives by email the day it leaves.</p><p><strong>Is shipping free?</strong></p><p>Yes, on orders over $150 in this demo. Smaller orders show the shipping price before checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "er_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Sizing",
            "anchor_id": "sizing",
            "content": "<p><strong>Which size should I choose?</strong></p><p>Start with the size you buy in everyday clothes. Costumes are labeled XS to 3XL, and wigs and kits are one size.</p><p><strong>Is there a measured size chart?</strong></p><p>Not yet. These are demo size labels, and measured charts are added as supplier samples are graded. A stylist can share any fit notes we have.</p>"
          }
        },
        "er_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "What is included",
            "anchor_id": "included",
            "content": "<p><strong>How do I know what comes in the set?</strong></p><p>Every product page has a contents list. If a piece is shown in the photos but not on the list, it is not included.</p><p><strong>Are shoes included?</strong></p><p>Only when the contents list says so. Plain shoes and underlayers are usually your own.</p>"
          }
        },
        "er_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Wigs",
            "anchor_id": "wigs",
            "content": "<p><strong>Will a wig fit me?</strong></p><p>Wigs are one size in this demo, and the fit is not verified yet. A size check can tell you what we know.</p><p><strong>Do wigs come styled?</strong></p><p>Yes. Each wig is shown front, back and side in the shape it ships in.</p>"
          }
        },
        "er_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Returns",
            "anchor_id": "returns",
            "content": "<p><strong>What is the return window?</strong></p><p>Thirty days from delivery for unworn pieces with tags attached, in the original packaging.</p>"
          }
        },
        "er_6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Accessibility",
            "anchor_id": "access",
            "content": "<p><strong>How is the store built?</strong></p><p>EVERREAL uses Quadratum navigation, product galleries, filters and labeled forms. Contact us if you need help browsing this demonstration store.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
